<title>The Philippines: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/philippines/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-philippines-2026-10-21T18:48:20.119Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 18:48:20 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Chinese coast guard and navy vessels continue to monitor Philippine supply missions to a grounded ship at Ren'ai Jiao and are shadowing a U.S. warship near a disputed shoal, while the Philippines has summoned China’s ambassador over threatening remarks. Vice Admiral Rommel Supangan leads the Philippine Coast Guard, recently rescuing four people, including a child, on Hagonoy Island, Surigao del Sur. Taiwan’s coast guard and maritime forces repelled sixteen mainland Chinese ships near the Pratas Islands. The United States and the Philippines held their sixteenth bilateral maritime exercise in the West Philippine Sea. There were 176 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nikkei Asia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihwFBVV95cUxPRTYtQ1lMT1AtYkxQdFhoRjlLeHgtTkptaWlLZnhlcUdSNVhmVFVDeE1CejVWUEpoT245ZU5iUnQ1bE1JT015bmwxdF83THNpclZUTUwyRUJpbVF3UWlxa1J2SDNBWm5xZXk3YmNBeUo1S2NrMEFVWE41bkJDUDNzazRPUHJoc0U?oc=5&quot;&gt;Yahoo News Singapore&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifkFVX3lxTE1GUTVNLTVna2RkQ184a29MREJpYUgyTFA4eHYzd2xULUl5dTBzemc2QWJpY2lEZjU5UERKVmV6ZmctUWR2V2tBWFRqVGxmZGlzRUJYQTJQZGxzaVFNWnRmR1U0aUpyVXBERUplc3JGbWRPYThQZFZhZlg1Qk9EUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;China Daily&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiYkFVX3lxTE5UX1N5T0U0WUpRRUExOEJ4aHI1R1R4dDgzcXJKWXo0WmgtZEoxUXQ2azFTZTA1WC1vWU4wRmZzTUstUjkyR0VCSG5RLUNNSTQySjBLWUxZTGg0QlEwdGZQMHZR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Global Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxONEM0cXhZUFhMQkJNZzloSHk5Snh2VlJZdU5YczFEV05pbWhfcWhORjFJU1NXRTBsUUNEb2lxMDJvOWFIRFhpcVB4UEo0RFU2QndnZDAwRE5yOXJneWhDLUpMbGdIYzZqOEk4RDAtYnhySXpPTWZHUGtZS1N1ZkZTU0NHcTBqZmMzQkhVWlVRUDRrb3RyQldwdjlyVUo1NGJs?oc=5&quot;&gt;S